hey are the weakest among other <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quaras</a> but deal a lot of damage with magical attacks. Since they're slow, shooters won't need much space to run.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></b>: Try to avoid other quaras and just melee it. Exori if you are surrounded by 3 or more quaras.<br/>\n<b>Mages</b>: You can take it down pretty quickly with <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">energy strike</a> and HMMs, but be ready to cast a healing spell.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></b>: Attack from distance or use shield and throwing weapon.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 26, 2024, the patch increased its experience from 250 to 380 as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 21,035 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-100</td>\n<td>33.6</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"87.7